<title>CANADA: UGG details W.Canada wheat supply and dispositions.</title>
<headline>UGG details W.Canada wheat supply and dispositions.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Grain Growers Ltd on Wednesday issued its supply and disposition estimates for wheat in the 1996/97 (Aug/July) crop year.</p>
<p>SUPPLY     96/97 Est.  95/96 Est.  5-yr-avg ('000 tonnes)</p>
<p>opn stcks  6,633	 5,679	 9,868</p>
<p>output    29,752	25,037	27,522</p>
<p>imports	 20	    20	    19</p>
<p>total:    36,405	30,736	37,409</p>
<p>USE</p>
<p>exports   19,000	16,000	20,152</p>
<p>seed	 1,300	 1,247	 1,194</p>
<p>human food 2,700	 2,609	 2,581</p>
<p>feed/waste 4,800	 4,247	 4,344</p>
<p>total:    27,800	24,103	28,271</p>
<p>CARRYOVER  8,605	 6,633	 9,138</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
